{"id":"cae2c5219270d535","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-tensor-product.md","title":"Tensor Product of Hilbert Spaces","display":"df-tensor-product — Tensor Product of Hilbert Spaces","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-tensor-product","aliases":["58-df-tensor-product"],"display":"df-tensor-product — Tensor Product of Hilbert Spaces","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-tensor-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-tensor-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tensor-product — Tensor Product of Hilbert Spaces"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce5a656462edb0c9\" href=\"?note=ce5a656462edb0c9\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md\">../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,K,A,L,T,B_H,B_K,B_A,B_T,+_H,+_K,+_A,+_L,+_T,\\odot_H,\\odot_K,\\odot_A,\\odot_L,\\odot_T,\\tau,\\beta,u,j\\in V\">\\(H,K,A,L,T,B_H,B_K,B_A,B_T,+_H,+_K,+_A,+_L,+_T,\\odot_H,\\odot_K,\\odot_A,\\odot_L,\\odot_T,\\tau,\\beta,u,j\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>标量域固定为标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb C\">\\(\\mathbb C\\)</span>，其运算图为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span>，零、幺元为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1\">\\(0,1\\)</span>。二元函数应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x,y)\">\\(B(x,y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_A(x,y)\">\\(+_A(x,y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\odot_A(a,x)\">\\(\\odot_A(a,x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(x,y)\">\\(\\tau(x,y)\\)</span> 分别缩写对有序对的函数图应用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\)</span> 使用所列内部依赖；内积对第一变量线性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下列带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Data}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Data}_S\\)</span> 的关系显式记录全部向量运算。原有只显示载体的元语言名字仍保留相同参数表，并定义为相应数据关系的存在投影；需要共用结构的复合定义只量化一次运算见证。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>完备化取等距、线性、稠密嵌入的含义，不规定唯一的载体编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(u;A,+_A,\\odot_A,L,+_L,\\odot_L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(L,+_L,\\odot_L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,A,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\bigl(u(+_A(x,y))=+_L(u(x),u(y))\n\\land u(\\odot_A(a,x))=\\odot_L(a,u(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(u;A,+_A,\\odot_A,L,+_L,\\odot_L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(L,+_L,\\odot_L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,A,L)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\bigl(u(+_A(x,y))=+_L(u(x),u(y))\n\\land u(\\odot_A(a,x))=\\odot_L(a,u(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\beta;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(H,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(K,+_K,\\odot_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\beta,H\\times K,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in H\\;\\forall y,y&#39;\\in K\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\beta(+_H(x,x&#39;),y)=+_A(\\beta(x,y),\\beta(x&#39;,y))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\beta(x,+_K(y,y&#39;))=+_A(\\beta(x,y),\\beta(x,y&#39;))\n\\land\\beta(\\odot_H(a,x),y)=\\odot_A(a,\\beta(x,y))\n\\land\\beta(x,\\odot_K(a,y))=\\odot_A(a,\\beta(x,y))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\beta;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(H,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(K,+_K,\\odot_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\beta,H\\times K,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in H\\;\\forall y,y&#39;\\in K\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\beta(+_H(x,x&#39;),y)=+_A(\\beta(x,y),\\beta(x&#39;,y))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\beta(x,+_K(y,y&#39;))=+_A(\\beta(x,y),\\beta(x,y&#39;))\n\\land\\beta(\\odot_H(a,x),y)=\\odot_A(a,\\beta(x,y))\n\\land\\beta(x,\\odot_K(a,y))=\\odot_A(a,\\beta(x,y))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall L,+_L,\\odot_L,\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\beta;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,L,+_L,\\odot_L)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists!u\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(u;A,+_A,\\odot_A,L,+_L,\\odot_L)\n\\land u\\circ\\tau=\\beta\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall L,+_L,\\odot_L,\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\beta;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,L,+_L,\\odot_L)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\exists!u\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(u;A,+_A,\\odot_A,L,+_L,\\odot_L)\n\\land u\\circ\\tau=\\beta\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_A;A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B_A,A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,H\\times K,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B_H,H\\times H,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B_K,K\\times K,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in H\\;\\forall y,y&#39;\\in K\\;\nB_A(\\tau(x,y),\\tau(x&#39;,y&#39;))=B_H(x,x&#39;)B_K(y,y&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_A;A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B_A,A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,H\\times K,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B_H,H\\times H,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B_K,K\\times K,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,x&#39;\\in H\\;\\forall y,y&#39;\\in K\\;\nB_A(\\tau(x,y),\\tau(x&#39;,y&#39;))=B_H(x,x&#39;)B_K(y,y&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(T,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B_A,A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(T,B_T,\\mathbb C,+_T,\\odot_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(j;A,+_A,\\odot_A,T,+_T,\\odot_T)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(B_T(j(x),j(y))=B_A(x,y))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;\nB_T\\bigl(+_T(t,\\odot_T(-1,j(a))),+_T(t,\\odot_T(-1,j(a)))\\bigr)&lt;\\varepsilon^2.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(T,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B_A,A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(T,B_T,\\mathbb C,+_T,\\odot_T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(j;A,+_A,\\odot_A,T,+_T,\\odot_T)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(B_T(j(x),j(y))=B_A(x,y))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;\nB_T\\bigl(+_T(t,\\odot_T(-1,j(a))),+_T(t,\\odot_T(-1,j(a)))\\bigr)&lt;\\varepsilon^2.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ComplexVectorSpace}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ComplexVectorSpace}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Linear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u;A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_A,\\odot_A,+_L,\\odot_L\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(u;A,+_A,\\odot_A,L,+_L,\\odot_L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Linear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u;A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_A,\\odot_A,+_L,\\odot_L\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(u;A,+_A,\\odot_A,L,+_L,\\odot_L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Bilinear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\beta;H,K,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K,+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\beta;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,A,+_A,\\odot_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Bilinear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\beta;H,K,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K,+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\beta;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,A,+_A,\\odot_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InnerProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B_A,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B_A,A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InnerProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B_A,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B_A,A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AlgebraicTensorProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AlgebraicTensorProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TensorInnerProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B_A;A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_A;A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TensorInnerProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B_A;A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_A;A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Completion}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,j;A,B_A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(T,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Completion}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,j;A,B_A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(T,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{HilbertTensorProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,j;H,B_H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,B_K,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(K,B_K,\\mathbb C,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,B_A,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_A;A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(T,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{HilbertTensorProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,j;H,B_H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,B_K,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(K,B_K,\\mathbb C,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,B_A,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_A;A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(T,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留全部原有元语言谓词名、参数次序以及 Hilbert 张量积的普遍性质—内积—完备化构造。结构敏感的核心关系共用同一组运算，不允许在不同合取项中换选代数结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce5a656462edb0c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-inner-product.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,K,A,L,T,B_H,B_K,B_A,B_T,+_H,+_K,+_A,+_L,+_T,\\odot_H,\\odot_K,\\odot_A,\\odot_L,\\odot_T,\\tau,\\beta,u,j\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1","display":false},{"tex":"B(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"+_A(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\odot_A(a,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Data}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A,+_{\\mathbb C},\\cdot_{\\mathbb C},0,1).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(u;A,+_A,\\odot_A,L,+_L,\\odot_L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(L,+_L,\\odot_L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(u,A,L)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\n\\bigl(u(+_A(x,y))=+_L(u(x),u(y))\n\\land u(\\odot_A(a,x))=\\odot_L(a,u(x))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\beta;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(H,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(K,+_K,\\odot_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\beta,H\\times K,A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,x'\\in H\\;\\forall y,y'\\in K\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\Bigl(\n\\beta(+_H(x,x'),y)=+_A(\\beta(x,y),\\beta(x',y))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\beta(x,+_K(y,y'))=+_A(\\beta(x,y),\\beta(x,y'))\n\\land\\beta(\\odot_H(a,x),y)=\\odot_A(a,\\beta(x,y))\n\\land\\beta(x,\\odot_K(a,y))=\\odot_A(a,\\beta(x,y))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall L,+_L,\\odot_L,\\beta\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\beta;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,L,+_L,\\odot_L)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\exists!u\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(u;A,+_A,\\odot_A,L,+_L,\\odot_L)\n\\land u\\circ\\tau=\\beta\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_A;A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B_A,A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\tau,H\\times K,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B_H,H\\times H,\\mathbb C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(B_K,K\\times K,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,x'\\in H\\;\\forall y,y'\\in K\\;\nB_A(\\tau(x,y),\\tau(x',y'))=B_H(x,x')B_K(y,y').\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(T,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B_A,A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(T,B_T,\\mathbb C,+_T,\\odot_T)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(j;A,+_A,\\odot_A,T,+_T,\\odot_T)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in A\\;(B_T(j(x),j(y))=B_A(x,y))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists a\\in A\\;\nB_T\\bigl(+_T(t,\\odot_T(-1,j(a))),+_T(t,\\odot_T(-1,j(a)))\\bigr)<\\varepsilon^2.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ComplexVectorSpace}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ComplexSpaceData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Linear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(u;A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_A,\\odot_A,+_L,\\odot_L\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexLinearData}_S(u;A,+_A,\\odot_A,L,+_L,\\odot_L).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Bilinear}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\beta;H,K,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_H,\\odot_H,+_K,\\odot_K,+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ComplexBilinearData}_S(\\beta;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K,A,+_A,\\odot_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InnerProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B_A,A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B_A,A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AlgebraicTensorProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TensorInnerProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(B_A;A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_A;A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Completion}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,j;A,B_A)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,+_A,\\odot_A\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(T,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{HilbertTensorProduct}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(T,j;H,B_H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,B_K,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,B_H,\\mathbb C,+_H,\\odot_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(K,B_K,\\mathbb C,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,B_A,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau;H,+_H,\\odot_H,K,+_K,\\odot_K)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_A;A,+_A,\\odot_A,\\tau,H,B_H,K,B_K)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(T,B_T,+_T,\\odot_T,j;A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6261,"backlinks":[{"id":"a4239c0a6290ab42","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}$、$\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}$、$\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}$ 取 [[58-df-tensor-product]] 的同名定义与参数次序。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-tensor-product.md|58-df-tensor-product]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["b70ce791d5b1a19b","592f9cfb66a507c2","ce5a656462edb0c9","36d7463d215be751"]}